<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑνιαῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>single, unitary,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.Quint.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					8.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσία ἑ. καὶ ἀμέριστος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Prm.</u>
					p.564S.
				</span></i>
			, etc.: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑνιαῖα</span>”
				<i>individual elements,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>in Nic.</u>
					p.81P.
				</span></i>
			; <i>concerned with unity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνῶσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					25b
				</span></i>
			is. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Comm. Math.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.589S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
